# GitHub Linguist 语言统计修正
# gavel = Spring Boot（Java）后端 + Vue 管理端 / 前端
#
# 诊断结果（.gitattributes 提交前）：
#   js 10,322,299 (80.4%) | css 1,318,293 (10.3%) | vue 519,974 (4.1%)
#   html 456,594 (3.6%) | java 213,854 (1.7%)   <- Java 后端被压到 1.7%
#
# 根因：仓库内提交了【已构建的前端产物】与【第三方库完整副本】，
#   单文件最大 2.07 MB（admin/dist/js/chunk-vendors.js）。
# 修正：以下路径均非本项目源码，排除出语言统计。

# --- 已构建的前端产物（bundled / minified）---
server/src/main/resources/admin/admin/dist/**   linguist-generated
server/src/main/resources/front/front/css/**    linguist-generated
server/src/main/resources/front/front/js/**     linguist-generated

# --- 第三方库完整副本（tinymce / elementui / vue 运行时等）---
server/src/main/resources/front/front/modules/**  linguist-vendored
server/src/main/resources/front/front/elementui/** linguist-vendored
server/src/main/resources/front/front/modules/tinymce/** linguist-vendored

# --- 前端依赖与构建配置 ---
**/node_modules/**        linguist-vendored
**/dist/**                linguist-generated
**/build/**               linguist-generated
**/*.min.js               linguist-generated
**/*.min.css              linguist-generated

# --- 锁文件 ---
**/package-lock.json      linguist-generated
**/yarn.lock              linguist-generated

# --- 文档 ---
docs/**                   linguist-documentation
*.md                      linguist-documentation
